#### 테스트 요청
#GET localhost:8080/foo
#Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: asdf

### 게시글 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/posts?page=1&size=20

### 에러 예시
GET http://localhost:8080/post/123


### 게시글 작성
POST http://localhost:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "제목입니다.",
  "content": "내용입니다."
}

### 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
